  message: "Dogfooding re-confirmed (blinded severity 3/5): resolution_quality meta-key contradicts its MetaKeySpec doc (axis_meta_keys.py:136-139) two ways — the documented example value 'ambiguous' is never emitted (only type_inferred=16301 + recovery=31), and the doc says 'Set alongside is_resolved=False' but all 31 `recovery` edges are is_resolved=True resolving to real method nodes. Same recovery+is_resolved decoupling fix. Sibling face (type_inferred mislabel) tracked at WI-javus. [dogfood]"  # 6b1e
- op: discuss  # 27be
