  nonce: 27be  # 27be
  message: "2026-06-10 design-interview ruling (ADR-0037, merged in PR #4181): is_resolved becomes purely 'dst is a real in-repo node', computed once at finalization and decoupled from resolution_quality provenance — so a recovery edge whose dst is a real in-repo node is legitimately is_resolved=True under the new contract. Waits on the finalization implementation to make that pairing principled rather than accidental."  # 27be
